+/// 🏷️ A cad object's name, stored language-neutrally in the event log and resolved at display time with the viewer's locale (`object_name`, `editor::cad::terminology`): a name the user typed is `Literal` text, a name the editor generated is the stable key it came from plus its ordinal, never a word of any language.
+#[derive(Clone, Debug, PartialEq, semio_framework_value_derive::ToValue, semio_framework_value_derive::FromValue)]
